2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m10-q.webp","width":678,"height":763},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m10-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1331}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\nΩ, Ω인 직렬회로에\nsinV의 전압을 인가할 때, 회로의 유효\n전력은 몇 kW인가?\n\n\n① 0.8          ② 1.0\n\n③ 1.2          ④ 2.4\n\n⑤ 3.2","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m11-q.webp","width":678,"height":531},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":551}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n각 상의 임피던스가 Ω인 3상 △결선 부하에\n\n3상 대칭 선간전압 200V를 인가할 때 부하의 상전류\n()와  선전류()는 몇 A인가?\n\n\n         상전류()            선전류()\n              \n ①                                                 \n              \n ②                                \n ③                            \n                                     \n ④                                                    \n ⑤                            ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m12-q.webp","width":678,"height":589},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m12-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\nsin의 라플라스 변환은?\n\n\n                       \n①        ② \n             \n③        ④ \n\n     \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m13-q.webp","width":696,"height":503},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m13-e1.webp","width":678,"height":783}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n다음과 같은 블록선도에서 전달함수는?\n\n\n\n\n\n                    \n①            ②  \n\n                     \n③            ④ \n\n     \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m14-q.webp","width":696,"height":730},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":566}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n다음과 같은 회로의 명칭은 무엇인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① AND         ② OR\n\n③ XOR         ④ 자기유지\n\n⑤ 인터록","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m15-q.webp","width":696,"height":650},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":534}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n폐루프 시스템의 특징에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 비례제어는 정상오차를 수반한다.\n\n② 비례제어는 조작량이 편차에 비례하여 연속적으로 제어\n\n  하는 변화하는 방식이다.\n\n③ 비례제어의 비례밴드(PB  : Proportional Band)는 100을\n\n  감도로 나눈 것이며 백분율로 나타낼 수 없다.\n\n④ 적분제어는 잔류편차를 제거하고 정상응답을 개선한다.\n\n⑤ 미분제어는 응답 속응성을 개선한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m16-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1055}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\nSCADA 시스템을 이용한 전기철도 운영의 장점이 아닌\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 전철 운행상태를 실시간으로 감시, 제어할 수 있다.\n\n② 다양한 센서와 장비로부터 실시간 데이터를 수집하거나\n\n  분석할 수 있다\n\n③ 원격으로 전철계통의 각 설비를 제어할 수 있다\n\n④ 초기 투자비가 적고 유지보수가 용이하다.\n\n⑤ 전원의 무정전 확보 또는 기계적 결함의 조기발견으로\n\n  안전성을 향상할 수 있다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m17-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":827}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n다음 중 압력을 측정하는 계측장치가 아닌 것은?\n\n\n① 다이어프램       ② 오리피스\n\n③ 스트레인 게이지    ④ 부르돈관\n\n⑤ 벨로우즈","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m18-q.webp","width":678,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":515}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n전기철도의 급전방식 중 하나인 직류 급전방식의 특징이\n\n아닌 것은?\n\n\n① 전압이 낮아 절연계급을 낮출 수 있다.\n\n② 절연레벨 저감으로 인한 절연비용 절감된다.\n\n③ 통신선 유도장해가 없다.\n\n④ 경량 및 단거리 수송에 유리하다.\n\n⑤ 전식이 발생하지 않아 전식방지 대책이 필요하지 않다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m19-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1367}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n전식의 방지대책으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 지중 매설물과 레일에 배류기를 설치하여 전기적으로\n\n  연결한다.\n\n② 레일본드 및 레일 크로스본드를 설치한다.\n\n③ 보조귀선을 설치한다.\n\n④ 변전소의 간격을 늘린다.\n\n⑤ 희생양극법을 사용한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m20-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m20-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1023}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n가공전선로의 지지물간에 가설된 전선의 이도m와지지\n\n물간에 가설된 전선의 실제길이m를 계산하는 공식은?\n\n(단, 전선의 합성하중kgm, 지지물간 간격m,\n\n수평장력kg이다.)\n\n\n                 - 이도 -                   - 실제길이 -\n                           \n ①          \n                         \n ②           \n                           \n ③          \n                         \n ④           \n                        \n ⑤           ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m21-q.webp","width":696,"height":757},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":859}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n3상 3선식에서 대지 정전용량을 Fkm, 선간 정전\n용량을 Fkm라고 할 때, 작용 정전용량Fkm은\n\n어떻게 표현되는가?\n\n\n①        ② \n③        ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m22-q.webp","width":678,"height":706},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m22-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1041}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n직접접지 방식에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 계통의 과도 안정도가 나쁘다.\n\n② 1선 지락시 건전상의 전압상승이 최소이다.\n\n③ 1선 지락시 지락전류가 크다.\n\n④ 1선 지락시 보호계전기의 동작이 확실하다.\n\n⑤ 1선 지락시 유도장해가 적다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m23-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":841},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m23-e2.webp","width":696,"height":879}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n정격용량이 500kVA인 동기 발전기의 %임피던스가\n\n5일 때, 발전기의 단락용량은 몇 MVA 인가?\n\n\n① 2           ② 5\n\n③ 10          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 50","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m24-q.webp","width":678,"height":534},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m24-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1005}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P060-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n1800rpm, 60Hz인 동기전동기의 극수와 1Hz에\n\n대한 기하학적인 각도는?\n\n\n\n       극수      기하학적인 각도rad\n\n ①       4극                  \n\n                                  \n ②       4극                       \n\n ③       2극                   \n\n\n ④       4극                   \n\n                                  \n ⑤       2극                       ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국철도공사(차량/운전) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e19-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m25-q.webp","width":696,"height":747},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e19-m25-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
